---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Dose Easy - Support"
  description="Need help with Dose Easy?"
  ogUrl="https://idlefusion.com/dose-easy/support"
>
  <main>
    <section class="section-padding">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-8">Support</h1>
        <div class="text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed mb-12">
          <p class="text-lg mb-4">Need help with Dose Easy?</p>
          <p>Contact <a href="mailto:support@idlefusion.com?subject=Dose%20Easy%20Support" class="text-[var(--accent-primary)] hover:underline">support@idlefusion.com</a> for help with reminders, checklist setup, and history review.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-6">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-2">How do reminders work?</h3>
              <p class="text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">Enable reminders per supplement and choose schedules that match your day. Notifications are local and no external account required.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-2">How do I mark compliance?</h3>
              <p class="text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">Use today’s checklist in the home screen and tap check-ins as you take each supplement.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-2">Can I view adherence history?</h3>
              <p class="text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">Yes. The history screen shows daily completion and trend behavior so you can adjust routines when needed.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-2">Does Dose Easy store cloud backups?</h3>
              <p class="text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">No. Your routines and history are stored on-device.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
